multiflexi-netbox for Debian
----------------------------

After installation the postinst runs:

  multiflexi-cli credential-prototype:sync

which registers the NetBox credential prototype (code: NetBox) in the
MultiFlexi database. Create a company credential with NETBOX_URL and
NETBOX_TOKEN, then assign it to runtemplates that require "NetBox".

Applications such as isp-tools (blocknet / unblocknet) consume these
environment variables via the NetBoxer network backend.
